window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>An alien being has escaped to Earth.</b></p> <p>The portal is occupied by American troops, and the only humans who have ever set foot on the alien planet are in CIA custody. To make matters worse, a hostile force is now threatening both Xibalbá and Earth.</p> <p>Can Tyler and Adriana save their new friends on the other side of the portal—and save their home planet from invasion at the same time?</p>"; 
